  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsUnitDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row4Member">％</jpcrp_cor:MetricsUnitDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row5Member">コンプライアンス研修を受けた従業員割合</jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
